      "match_notes": "Gorran won the toss and chose to bat first on a good batting track against a young Roche team, scoring 300-8 off their 45 overs, O Matthews (83), J Semple (77), S Dixon (24), A Constantine (20) and J Goostrey (20*) with the runs. P Trethewey (3-51), D Jeffery (2-68) and J Inch (2-97) taking the wickets for Roche.<br>In reply Roche were bowled out for a 166, T Rowe (28), T Trudgeon (27), D Jeffery (20) and 12 year old debutant H Gregory (17) scoring the Roche runs. D Pascoe (3-21), M Liddicoat (2-13) and A Kendall (2-40) with the wickets for Gorran.",
